#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/6-vive_tracker.md:29
#: f5dc296a55574b299009a1e844822d19
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`tracker_openvr` publishes these two poses. A side with no tracker "
"publishes an identity pose while any live side is enabled. Headset pose, "
"sticks, and triggers stay on {ref}`the teleop pose stream <teleop-pose-"
"stream>`."
msgstr ""
"`tracker_openvr` 发布这两条位姿。只要还有一侧在发，没装 Tracker 的那一侧就发单位位姿。头显位姿、摇杆和扳机见 "
"{ref}`遥操位姿流 <teleop-pose-stream>`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/6-vive_tracker.md:31
#: c76bc9bcecbc426a9dd99893812c8f68
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/4-reference/teleop/6-vive_tracker.md:33
#: f73657dc0d6c4a6384f32c9698164624
msgid ""
"Copy `trackers.example.yaml` to `trackers.yaml` and fill each tracker "
"serial. That example sets `publish_rate_hz` to 120, plus "
"`wrist_C_rpy_deg`, `wrist_offset`, and `room_yaw_deg`. The package README"
" lists the fields."
msgstr ""
"把 `trackers.example.yaml` 复制成 `trackers.yaml`，填上每个 Tracker 的序列号。示例里 "
"`publish_rate_hz` 为 120，还有 `wrist_C_rpy_deg`、`wrist_offset` 和 "
"`room_yaw_deg`。各字段说明在包的 README 里。"

